    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Dance of Maple Leaves It is a single-player RPG real-time combat and cultivation game. Players will explore the Wangchuan Continent. In the game, players need to obtain level equipment materials from monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay 1: There is a large open exploration map of the main city, five small maps of dungeons, dungeon bosses, wilderness bosses, wilderness treasure houses, etc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay 2: The equipment attribute upgrade system allows all basic attributes to be upgraded to a maximum of 10 points. There is also an equipment appraisal system, and all equipment can be appraised. The grades are divided into Excellent, Sophisticated, Epic, and Legendary. Each grade will correspond to different additional item attributes, and a maximum of 6 item attributes can be obtained.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay 3: The quest system guides players. It can not only lead players forward but also enable them to obtain a considerable amount of money and items.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Dance of Maple Leaves It is a single-player RPG real-time combat and cultivation game. Players will explore the Wangchuan Continent. In the game, players need to obtain level equipment materials from monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay 1: There is a large open exploration map of the main city, five small maps of dungeons, dungeon bosses, wilderness bosses, wilderness treasure houses, etc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay 2: The equipment attribute upgrade system allows all basic attributes to be upgraded to a maximum of 10 points. There is also an equipment appraisal system, and all equipment can be appraised. The grades are divided into Excellent, Sophisticated, Epic, and Legendary. Each grade will correspond to different additional item attributes, and a maximum of 6 item attributes can be obtained.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay 3: The quest system guides players. It can not only lead players forward but also enable them to obtain a considerable amount of money and items.</p>",
    "short_description": "The Dance of Maple Leaves Single-player role-playing combat game Gameplay 1: Open-world exploration map, dungeon maps, and world boss battles. Gameplay 2: Equipment upgrade system, equipment identification system. Gameplay 3: Quest system",
